   "date": "2016-11-30",
   "house": "senate",
   "question": "Katy Gallagher by leave—I move amendments (1) and (2) on sheet 8018: (1) Schedule 1, item 6, page 5 (line 15) omit \"15%\", substitute \"10.5%\". [tax rate for part of working holiday income not exceeding $37,000] (2) Schedule 1, item 7, page 5 (table item 1), omit \"15%\", substitute \"10.5%\". [tax rate for part of working holiday income not exceeding $37,000] And I move that the question be put. The CHAIR: The question is that the question be now put. The CHAIR: The question is that the requests standing in the name of Senator Gallagher be agreed to. The CHAIR: The question is that the bill be passed subject to requests. Bill reported with requests.",
